{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Inference Optimization Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: KV Cache from Scratch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "We build a multi-head KV cache that stores key and value projections per layer, per head, and demonstrates the memory growth pattern."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class KVCache:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, num_layers, num_heads, head_dim, max_seq_len, dtype=np.float16):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.num_layers = num_layers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.num_heads = num_heads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.head_dim = head_dim"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.max_seq_len = max_seq_len"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.dtype = dtype"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.k_cache = np.zeros("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            (num_layers, num_heads, max_seq_len, head_dim), dtype=dtype"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.v_cache = np.zeros("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            (num_layers, num_heads, max_seq_len, head_dim), dtype=dtype"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.seq_len = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def update(self, layer_idx, new_keys, new_values):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        num_new = new_keys.shape[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        end = self.seq_len + num_new"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.k_cache[layer_idx, :, self.seq_len:end, :] = new_keys"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.v_cache[layer_idx, :, self.seq_len:end, :] = new_values"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.k_cache[layer_idx, :, :end, :],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.v_cache[layer_idx, :, :end, :]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        )"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def advance(self, num_tokens):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.seq_len += num_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def memory_bytes(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return self.k_cache.nbytes + self.v_cache.nbytes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def used_bytes(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        per_token = 2 * self.num_layers * self.num_heads * self.head_dim * np.dtype(self.dtype).itemsize"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return per_token * self.seq_len"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Attention with KV Cache"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "A simplified multi-head attention that uses the KV cache for decode steps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def scaled_dot_product_attention(query, keys, values):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    head_dim = query.shape[-1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    scores = np.matmul(query, keys.transpose(0, 1, 3, 2)) / np.sqrt(head_dim)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    seq_len_q = scores.shape[-2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    seq_len_k = scores.shape[-1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if seq_len_q > 1:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        mask = np.triu(np.ones((seq_len_q, seq_len_k), dtype=np.float32), k=seq_len_k - seq_len_q + 1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        scores = scores + mask * (-1e9)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    max_scores = np.max(scores, axis=-1, keepdims=True)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    exp_scores = np.exp(scores - max_scores)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    attn_weights = exp_scores / np.sum(exp_scores, axis=-1, keepdims=True)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return np.matmul(attn_weights, values)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class MultiHeadAttention:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, d_model, num_heads):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.num_heads = num_heads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.head_dim = d_model // num_heads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        scale = np.sqrt(2.0 / d_model)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.W_q = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model).astype(np.float32) * scale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.W_k = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model).astype(np.float32) * scale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.W_v = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model).astype(np.float32) * scale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.W_o = np.random.randn(d_model, d_model).astype(np.float32) * scale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def forward(self, x, kv_cache=None, layer_idx=0):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        batch, seq_len, d_model = x.shape"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        Q = np.matmul(x, self.W_q).reshape(batch, seq_len, self.num_heads, self.head_dim).transpose(0, 2, 1, 3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        K = np.matmul(x, self.W_k).reshape(batch, seq_len, self.num_heads, self.head_dim).transpose(0, 2, 1, 3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        V = np.matmul(x, self.W_v).reshape(batch, seq_len, self.num_heads, self.head_dim).transpose(0, 2, 1, 3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if kv_cache is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            K_full, V_full = kv_cache.update(layer_idx, K[0], V[0])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            K = K_full[np.newaxis, :, :, :]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            V = V_full[np.newaxis, :, :, :]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if seq_len == 1:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                kv_cache.advance(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        attn_out = scaled_dot_product_attention(Q, K, V)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        attn_out = attn_out.transpose(0, 2, 1, 3).reshape(batch, -1, d_model)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return np.matmul(attn_out, self.W_o)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Continuous Batching Simulator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This simulates the scheduling difference between static and continuous batching."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import heapq"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class Request:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, request_id, prompt_tokens, output_tokens, arrival_step):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.request_id = request_id"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.prompt_tokens = prompt_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.output_tokens = output_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.arrival_step = arrival_step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.tokens_generated = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.start_step = None"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.end_step = None"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def is_done(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return self.tokens_generated >= self.output_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def simulate_static_batching(requests, batch_size):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    step = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    completed = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    queue = list(requests)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    queue.sort(key=lambda r: r.arrival_step)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    while queue:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        batch = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while queue and len(batch) < batch_size:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r = queue.pop(0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r.start_step = max(step, r.arrival_step)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            batch.append(r)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if batch:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            step = max(step, max(r.start_step for r in batch))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            max_output = max(r.output_tokens for r in batch)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for r in batch:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                r.tokens_generated = r.output_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                r.end_step = step + max_output"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            step += max_output"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            completed.extend(batch)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return completed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def simulate_continuous_batching(requests, batch_size):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    step = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    completed = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    queue = sorted(requests, key=lambda r: r.arrival_step)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    queue_idx = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    active = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    waiting = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    while queue_idx < len(queue) or active or waiting:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while queue_idx < len(queue) and queue[queue_idx].arrival_step <= step:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            waiting.append(queue[queue_idx])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            queue_idx += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while waiting and len(active) < batch_size:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r = waiting.pop(0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r.start_step = step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            active.append(r)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not active:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if waiting:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                step += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            elif queue_idx < len(queue):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                step = queue[queue_idx].arrival_step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for r in active:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r.tokens_generated += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        done = [r for r in active if r.is_done()]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for r in done:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r.end_step = step + 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            completed.append(r)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        active = [r for r in active if not r.is_done()]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        step += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return completed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def batching_stats(completed):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    latencies = [r.end_step - r.arrival_step for r in completed]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    total_time = max(r.end_step for r in completed) - min(r.arrival_step for r in completed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    total_tokens = sum(r.output_tokens for r in completed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"avg_latency\": np.mean(latencies),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"p50_latency\": np.median(latencies),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"p99_latency\": np.percentile(latencies, 99),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"total_time\": total_time,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"throughput\": total_tokens / total_time if total_time > 0 else 0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Prefix Cache"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "A trie-based prefix cache that stores KV entries for shared prefixes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class TrieNode:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.children = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.kv_data = None"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.hit_count = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class PrefixCache:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, max_entries=1000):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.root = TrieNode()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.max_entries = max_entries"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.total_entries = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.hits = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.misses = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _walk(self, token_ids):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        node = self.root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        depth = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for tid in token_ids:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if tid not in node.children:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            node = node.children[tid]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            depth += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return node, depth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def lookup(self, token_ids):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        node, depth = self._walk(token_ids)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if depth > 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.hits += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            current = self.root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for tid in token_ids[:depth]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                current = current.children[tid]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                current.hit_count += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            kv_entries = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            current = self.root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for tid in token_ids[:depth]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                current = current.children[tid]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                if current.kv_data is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    kv_entries.append(current.kv_data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return depth, kv_entries"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.misses += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return 0, []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def insert(self, token_ids, kv_per_token):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        node = self.root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i, tid in enumerate(token_ids):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if tid not in node.children:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                if self.total_entries >= self.max_entries:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                    return i"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                node.children[tid] = TrieNode()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.total_entries += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            node = node.children[tid]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if i < len(kv_per_token):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                node.kv_data = kv_per_token[i]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return len(token_ids)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def hit_rate(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total = self.hits + self.misses"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return self.hits / total if total > 0 else 0.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: Speculative Decoding Simulator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "We simulate draft-target speculative decoding with configurable acceptance rates."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class DraftModel:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, vocab_size, acceptance_rate=0.8):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.vocab_size = vocab_size"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.acceptance_rate = acceptance_rate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def generate(self, context, num_tokens):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        tokens = np.random.randint(0, self.vocab_size, size=num_tokens)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def get_probs(self, context, token):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        probs = np.random.dirichlet(np.ones(self.vocab_size))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return probs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class TargetModel:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, vocab_size):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.vocab_size = vocab_size"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def get_probs(self, context, tokens=None):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if tokens is not None:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return [np.random.dirichlet(np.ones(self.vocab_size)) for _ in tokens]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return np.random.dirichlet(np.ones(self.vocab_size))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def speculative_decode(draft_model, target_model, context, num_speculative=5,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                       draft_cost=1.0, target_cost=10.0, verify_cost=12.0):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    total_tokens = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    total_cost = 0.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    accepted_counts = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    context = list(context)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    max_tokens = 100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    while total_tokens < max_tokens:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        draft_tokens = draft_model.generate(context, num_speculative)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total_cost += draft_cost * num_speculative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        target_probs = target_model.get_probs(context, draft_tokens)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total_cost += verify_cost"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        accepted = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for i, token in enumerate(draft_tokens):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            draft_p = draft_model.get_probs(context + list(draft_tokens[:i]), token)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            target_p = target_probs[i]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            r = np.random.random()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            acceptance_prob = min(1.0, target_p[token] / (draft_p[token] + 1e-10))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if r < draft_model.acceptance_rate:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                accepted += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                context.append(token)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                total_tokens += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                new_token = np.random.choice(draft_model.vocab_size, p=target_p)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                context.append(new_token)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                total_tokens += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                break"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        accepted_counts.append(accepted)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if accepted == num_speculative:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            bonus_probs = target_model.get_probs(context)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            bonus_token = np.random.choice(draft_model.vocab_size, p=bonus_probs)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            context.append(bonus_token)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            total_tokens += 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sequential_cost = total_tokens * target_cost"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"total_tokens\": total_tokens,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"speculative_cost\": total_cost,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"sequential_cost\": sequential_cost,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"speedup\": sequential_cost / total_cost if total_cost > 0 else 1.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"avg_accepted\": np.mean(accepted_counts),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        \"acceptance_rate\": np.mean(accepted_counts) / num_speculative,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def compare_speculation_strategies(vocab_size=1000, num_trials=20):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    results = {}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for name, acceptance_rate, spec_tokens in ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        (\"Draft-target (8B->70B)\", 0.78, 5),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        (\"EAGLE\", 0.85, 6),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        (\"N-gram\", 0.50, 4),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        (\"No speculation\", 0.0, 0),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ]:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if spec_tokens == 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            results[name] = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                \"speedup\": 1.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                \"acceptance_rate\": 0.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                \"avg_accepted\": 0.0,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        trial_results = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for _ in range(num_trials):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            draft = DraftModel(vocab_size, acceptance_rate=acceptance_rate)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            target = TargetModel(vocab_size)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            context = list(np.random.randint(0, vocab_size, size=10))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            result = speculative_decode(draft, target, context, num_speculative=spec_tokens)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            trial_results.append(result)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        results[name] = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"speedup\": np.mean([r[\"speedup\"] for r in trial_results]),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"acceptance_rate\": np.mean([r[\"acceptance_rate\"] for r in trial_results]),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            \"avg_accepted\": np.mean([r[\"avg_accepted\"] for r in trial_results]),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 6: KV Cache Memory Profiler"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Compute KV cache memory requirements for real model configurations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "MODEL_CONFIGS = {"
      ]
    },
